# Ukrainian "this" demonstrative, the full pronominal paradigm.  "цього тижня"
# and "цього року" are the ordinary forms and both are genitive.  The dative
# "цьому" is listed but the homograph "тому" is NOT: in Ukrainian "тому" is the
# ago-marker ("два дні тому"), and folding it in here would read a past offset
# as a present one.  *Український правопис* (2019), declension of pronouns.
# https://nus.org.ua/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Ukr.-pravopys-2019-1.pdf
цей
цього
цьому
цим
ця
цієї
цій
цю
цією
це
ці
цих
цими
